WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Upload a lecture PDF in the real Kelus app.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Kelus finds topics in the lecture and prepares the first question.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Answer quick checks, then explain the idea in your own words.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Compare your answer with the source and mark what still needs work.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Return to the study plan to see what Kelus recommends next.
